  "content": [
    {
      "text": "Wrestlings. Sixth son of Jacob, and second child of Bilhah, Rachel’s slave (Gen. 30:8); his four sons (Gen. 46:24; Ex. 1:4; 1 Chr. 7:13); the blessing on the tribe (Gen. 49:21; Deut. 33:23); land of Naphtali (Josh. 19:32–39). Barak of Kedesh-Naphtali was the one man of note belonging to the tribe (Judg. 4:6; 5:15–18). The history of the tribe ends with the captivity under Tiglath-pileser, but see Isa. 9:1; Ezek. 48:3–4, 34; Matt. 4:15; Rev. 7:6.",
